OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening and mostly cloudy with
OL,7,Fsome clear intervals. Staying dry
OL,8,Fovernight with some longer clear
OL,9,Fspells developing. Windy at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FThe day will continue dry with
OL,12,Fbright or sunny spells increasing into
OL,13,Fthe afternoon. Cloud will spread east
OL,14,Fin the evening. Winds easing.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fwith outbreaks of rain spreading east
OL,18,FSaturday. Sunday and Monday will
OL,19,Fcontinue mostly dry with bright or
OL,20,Fsunny spells. Increasing fog risk
OL,21,FMonday.
